#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/viewer/frame-buffer.rst:2
msgid "The frame buffer viewer"
msgstr "帧缓冲区查看器"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/viewer/frame-buffer.rst:4
msgid ""
"The frame buffer viewer shows what the camera sees -- more precisely, "
"whatever the running script last left in the camera's frame buffer. "
"Everything the script draws on the image is there too, so the preview shows "
"the frame *after* the script's processing, annotations included. The Viewer "
"polls the camera for the latest frame over USB and displays each one as it "
"arrives."
msgstr ""
"帧缓冲区查看器显示摄像头所看到的画面——更确切地说，是正在运行的脚本最后留在摄像头帧缓冲区中的内容。脚本在图像上绘制的一切也都在其中，因此预览显示的是脚本处理*之后*的帧，包括各种标注。Viewer"
" 通过 USB 向摄像头轮询最新的帧，并在每一帧到达时将其显示出来。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/viewer/frame-buffer.rst:12
msgid ""
"The frame buffer pane showing a live image with a selection rectangle over "
"one object, the Zoom, Disable, and JPG Mode buttons in the title bar, and "
"the histogram below computing from the selection"
msgstr ""
"帧缓冲区窗格显示一幅实时图像，其中一个对象上方有一个选择矩形，标题栏中有 Zoom、Disable 和 JPG Mode "
"按钮，下方的直方图根据所选内容进行计算"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/viewer/frame-buffer.rst:12
msgid ".. image:: ../ide/figures/frame-buffer.png"
msgstr ".. image:: ../ide/figures/frame-buffer.png"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/viewer/frame-buffer.rst:16
msgid ""
"The frame buffer with a region selected: the readout line and the histogram "
"below it compute from the selected pixels only."
msgstr "选中了某个区域的帧缓冲区：读数行及其下方的直方图仅根据所选像素进行计算。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/viewer/frame-buffer.rst:20
msgid "The pane's title-bar buttons manage the preview:"
msgstr "该窗格标题栏中的按钮用于管理预览："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/viewer/frame-buffer.rst:22
msgid ""
"*Zoom* -- scale the image to fit the pane (on by default). Off, the image "
"renders at one screen pixel per image pixel."
msgstr "*Zoom*——缩放图像以适应窗格（默认开启）。关闭时，图像以每个图像像素对应一个屏幕像素的方式渲染。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/viewer/frame-buffer.rst:25
msgid ""
"*Disable* -- stop streaming frames entirely, for maximum camera-side "
"performance. The script keeps running; the preview freezes on the last frame"
" behind a \"Frame Buffer Disabled\" banner until you re-enable it."
msgstr ""
"*Disable*——完全停止帧的流传输，以获得最大的摄像头端性能。脚本继续运行；预览会冻结在最后一帧上，其上覆盖一条“Frame Buffer "
"Disabled”横幅，直到你重新启用它。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/viewer/frame-buffer.rst:30
msgid ""
"*JPG Mode / RAW Mode* -- whether frames are JPEG compressed for the trip to "
"the Viewer or sent uncompressed. JPG mode is much faster; RAW mode shows the"
" exact pixel values at the cost of frame rate. On newer cameras a greyed "
"label beside the button names the format the current frame arrived in."
msgstr ""
"*JPG Mode / RAW Mode*——帧在传往 Viewer 时是经过 JPEG 压缩还是以未压缩形式发送。JPG 模式快得多；RAW "
"模式以帧率为代价显示确切的像素值。在较新的摄像头上，按钮旁边有一个灰色标签会标明当前帧到达时所采用的格式。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/viewer/frame-buffer.rst:38
msgid "Selecting a region"
msgstr "选择一个区域"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/viewer/frame-buffer.rst:40
msgid ""
"Click and drag on the image to select a rectangular region. While a "
"selection exists, the histogram below computes its statistics from the "
"selected pixels only, and the readout line above the histogram reports the "
"selection's position, size, and pixel count. Click without dragging to read "
"off a single pixel's position; click outside the image to clear the "
"selection."
msgstr ""
"在图像上点击并拖动即可选择一个矩形区域。当存在选区时，下方的直方图仅根据所选像素计算其统计数据，直方图上方的读数行会报告选区的位置、大小和像素数量。点击而不拖动可读取单个像素的位置；在图像之外点击可清除选区。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/viewer/frame-buffer.rst:49
msgid "Saving what the camera sees"
msgstr "保存摄像头所看到的画面"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/tools/viewer/frame-buffer.rst:51
msgid ""
"Right-click the image to save the displayed frame to an image file on your "
"computer. The save respects the selection: right-click inside a selected "
"region and just that region is saved; right-click anywhere else and the "
"whole frame is saved. What lands on disk is the frame shown at the moment "
"you right-click -- to capture one exact frame from a moving scene, stop the "
"script first so the preview freezes on it."
msgstr ""
"右键点击图像可将显示的帧保存为你计算机上的一个图像文件。保存会遵循选区：在所选区域内右键点击，则仅保存该区域；在其他任何位置右键点击，则保存整个帧。落到磁盘上的是你右键点击那一刻所显示的帧——若要从运动场景中捕获某一确切帧，请先停止脚本，使预览冻结在该帧上。"
